--TEST--
`Core\Env::OS` is a `Core\Env::Platform` case, so a platform the enum does not name is a compile error where a misspelled string compared `false` — `rule:core-classes/env-context`
--FILE--
<?nvs
if (Core\Env::OS == Core\Env::Platform::Window) {
    echo "Windows\n";
}
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0405]: `Core\Env::Platform` has no case named `Window`
  --> case.nvs:2:21
